          {
            "collected": "2026-10-12T00:00:00Z",
            "description": "'X25519-ML-KEM-768' uses the hybrid X25519 + ML-KEM-768, which CNSA 2.0 does not approve: ML-KEM-768 is not ML-KEM-1024, and X25519 is not a CNSA 1.0 algorithm (ECDH or ECDSA over P-384, or RSA or DH of 3072 bits or more)",
